@HostAddress = http://127.0.0.1:5081
@apiKey = devkey

### List Release
GET {{HostAddress}}/release/list
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

### Save Release (empty id = new)
POST {{HostAddress}}/release
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

{
    "id": "",
    "name": "Nova expansão",
    "game": "Pokemon",
    "releaseDate": "2026-11-14",
    "preOrderDate": "2026-10-20",
    "url": null,
    "notes": "ETB, Booster Bundle, Display",
    "stockTaskId": null
}

### Delete Release
DELETE {{HostAddress}}/release?identifier=
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}
